    "Apidojo X Free plan is documented as demo-only and capped; verify plan before production API use. Bright Data is a fallback if credits allow.",
    "For X, maxItems is a run-wide limit; one-source runs avoid returning all items from the first account.",
    "Baseline quietly publishing sources may have nothing inside seven days. Compare latest baseline item and explicit fetch outcome; never infer zero updates from an empty failed run.",
    "Run API build option accepts build number/tag, not the buildId. Store both for reproducibility. maxTotalChargeUsd belongs in run options/query, not the actor input JSON.",
    "USD run caps must be reconciled to the shared EUR50 total including any plan purchase/tax/FX. Do not enable auto-recharge or permit ongoing paid renewal."
